Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince and Qiqi kept
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,flying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,still on their way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This time they came to a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,very very small planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So small that there was only one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,lamp post and one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That person held a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,match in their hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The lamp lit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.76,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The lamp went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it lit up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And went out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi asked curiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lighting the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The person said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the lamp in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,put it out at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But what time is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.14,0:00:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The person looked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This planet was so small,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it spun so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It just got bright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:01:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and immediately went
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,dark again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I just lit it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,now I have to put
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,it out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.89,0:01:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The person wiped sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,rest for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The rule is the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi thought for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've been doing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,the right thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,this planet wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,have any light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The person stopped and looked at
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the lamp in their hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The lamp went out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,they lit it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince said softly: Persisting in doing the right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,even when it's tiring,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,is really remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi nodded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do one right thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,every day from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The person kept
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,lighting the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But this tiny planet became so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,warm because of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what right thing did
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Qiqi in the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,comments
